   "id": "2-foundations-of-probability-events-set-calculus",
   "title": "2. Foundations of Probability, Events & Set Calculus",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "h3",
     "text": "2.1 Sample Spaces & Canonical Event Taxonomy"
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "items": [
      "**Sample Space ($S$):** The set of all mutually exclusive and collectively exhaustive elementary outcomes of a random experiment.",
      "**Event ($E$):** Any subset $E \\subseteq S$. $P(E) = n(E) / n(S)$ for equally likely outcomes.",
      "**Mutually Exclusive (Disjoint) Events:**"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "math",
     "tex": "A \\cap B = \\emptyset \\implies P(A \\cap B) = 0"
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "items": [
      "**Independent Events:**"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "math",
     "tex": "P(A \\cap B) = P(A) \\cdot P(B) \\iff P(A \\mid B) = P(A)"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "**LETHAL EXAM TRAP:** If $P(A) > 0$ and $P(B) > 0$, Mutually Exclusive events are **NEVER** Independent! If $A$ occurs, $B$ cannot occur ($P(B|A) = 0 \\ne P(B)$)."
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "items": [
      "**Collectively Exhaustive Events:** $A \\cup B \\cup \\dots = S \\implies P(A \\cup B \\cup \\dots) = 1$.",
      "**Odds in Favor vs Odds Against:**",
      "Odds in favor of $E = m : n \\implies P(E) = \\frac{m}{m + n}$",
      "Odds against $E = n : m \\implies P(E') = \\frac{n}{m + n} = 1 - P(E)$"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "h3",
     "text": "2.2 Kolmogorov's Axioms of Probability"
    },
    {
     "t": "ol",
     "start": 1,
     "items": [
      "**Axiom I (Non-negativity):** $P(E) \\ge 0$ for every event $E \\subseteq S$.",
      "**Axiom II (Certainty):** $P(S) = 1$, $P(\\emptyset) = 0$. Consequently, $0 \\le P(E) \\le 1$.",
      "**Axiom III (Countable Additivity):** For pairwise disjoint events $E_1, E_2, \\dots$:"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "math",
     "tex": "P\\left(\\bigcup_{i=1}^\\infty E_i\\right) = \\sum_{i=1}^\\infty P(E_i)"
    },
    {
     "t": "h3",
     "text": "2.3 Set-Theoretic Inclusion-Exclusion Formulas"
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "items": [
      "**Two-Event Union:**"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "math",
     "tex": "P(A \\cup B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\cap B)"
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "items": [
      "**Three-Event Union:**"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "math",
     "tex": "P(A \\cup B \\cup C) = P(A) + P(B) + P(C) - [P(AB) + P(BC) + P(CA)] + P(ABC)"
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "items": [
      "**Event Combinations Master Table:**"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "table",
     "header": [
      "Verbal Event Description",
      "Mathematical Set Expression",
      "Probability Formula"
     ],
     "align": [
      ":---",
      ":---",
      ":---"
     ],
     "rows": [
      [
       "At least one of $A, B$",
       "$A \\cup B$",
       "$P(A) + P(B) - P(AB)$"
      ],
      [
       "Exactly one of $A, B$",
       "$(A \\cap B') \\cup (A' \\cap B)$",
       "$P(A) + P(B) - 2P(AB) = P(A \\cup B) - P(AB)$"
      ],
      [
       "Neither $A$ nor $B$",
       "$A' \\cap B' = (A \\cup B)'$",
       "$1 - P(A \\cup B)$"
      ],
      [
       "At least one of $A, B, C$",
       "$A \\cup B \\cup C$",
       "$1 - P(A' \\cap B' \\cap C')$"
      ],
      [
       "Exactly one of $A, B, C$",
       "$(A B' C') \\cup (A' B C') \\cup (A' B' C)$",
       "$\\sum P(A) - 2 \\sum P(AB) + 3 P(ABC)$"
      ],
      [
       "Exactly two of $A, B, C$",
       "Pairwise overlaps excluding center",
       "$\\sum P(AB) - 3 P(ABC)$"
      ],
      [
       "At least two of $A, B, C$",
       "Overlaps including center",
       "$\\sum P(AB) - 2 P(ABC)$"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "h3",
     "text": "2.4 Multi-Dice Central Symmetry Theorem"
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "items": [
      "For $n$ fair 6-sided dice: Minimum sum = $n$, Maximum sum = $6n$.",
      "Center of Symmetry: $S_{\\text{center}} = \\frac{n + 6n}{2} = 3.5 n$.",
      "**Symmetry Identity:** For any integer offset $k$:"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "math",
     "tex": "P(\\text{Sum} = S_{\\text{center}} - k) = P(\\text{Sum} = S_{\\text{center}} + k)"
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "items": [
      "**Two Dice ($n=2$, Center = 7):**"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "math",
     "tex": "P(\\text{Sum} = s) = \\frac{6 - \\vert s - 7 \\vert}{36}, \\quad \\text{for } 2 \\le s \\le 12"
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "items": [
      "**Four Dice ($n=4$, Center = 14):**"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "math",
     "tex": "P(\\text{Sum} = 8) = P(\\text{Sum} = 20) = \\frac{35}{1296}"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Partitions of 8: $(1,1,1,5) \\to 4$, $(1,1,2,4) \\to 12$, $(1,1,3,3) \\to 6$, $(1,2,2,3) \\to 12$, $(2,2,2,2) \\to 1$. Total = 35."
    }
   ]
